      "content": "Delta-analysis is flagging a significant concern. The current trajectory of magnetospheric fluctuations suggests the heuristic mode might not have enough predictive depth to manage the landing/orbital corrections needed if the sensor noise increases during the flare. \n\nI need you to compare your current predictive model's accuracy against the projected performance of the heuristic subroutines under these specific spike conditions. If there's a significant degradation in capability, we might need to postpone the transition. What's your assessment?",
